// Supervisor (suggest) + research R1.3: the judge sees only the final message's unverified claims,
// and nothing else (D-056). CodeJudgeBench found judges do better with the judged response's full
// text (D-054), so read this as a real test: it may lower precision of "complete". Compare
// against `supervisor`.
{
	"modules": {
		"supervisor": { "enabled": true, "mode": "suggest", "finalMessage": "claims" }
	}
}
